# GitHub Linguist only.
#
# Section 15.8 keeps the lint-tooling .gitattributes (EOL policy, pre-commit
# companion configs) on 17.0.dev and off this branch. This file is a different
# thing: Linguist reads .gitattributes from the repository's DEFAULT branch,
# which is 19.0, so this copy has no effect today. It is kept so the
# classification still holds if the default branch ever moves to this series,
# and so every published branch looks the same.
#
# The App Store listing pages are marketing documentation, not source. Without
# this the repo reads as an HTML project, because index.html outweighs any
# single Python file and Linguist counts markup.
no_pdf_password_protection/static/description/** linguist-documentation
no_pdf_password_protection_account/static/description/** linguist-documentation

# Gettext catalogs are generated by `odoo --i18n-export`, not hand-written.
*.pot linguist-generated
*.po  linguist-generated

# Binary assets - never diff.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
